<title>USA: TABLE - USX-U.S. Steel Group Q2 net jumps.</title>
<headline>TABLE - USX-U.S. Steel Group Q2 net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter   Six Months</p>
<p>(Dollars in millions,</p>
<p>  except per share amounts)	1997    1996    1997    1996</p>
<p> REVENUES			    $1,721  $1,580  $3,341  $3,171</p>
<p>OPERATING COSTS:</p>
<p>  Cost of sales		     1,438   1,484   2,842   2,899</p>
<p>Selling, general and administrative</p>
<p>    expenses (credits)	     (33)    (39)    (70)    (80)</p>
<p>Depreciation, depletion</p>
<p>   and amortization		    79	75     153     153</p>
<p>  Taxes other than income taxes    60	59     119     117</p>
<p>    Total operating costs	 1,544   1,579   3,044   3,089</p>
<p> OPERATING INCOME		     177	 1     297	82</p>
<p> Gain on affiliate stock offering   -	53	 -	53</p>
<p> Other income			    17	13	28	21</p>
<p> Interest, other financial income   -	 2	 1	 3</p>
<p> Interest, other financial costs (38)    (29)    (50)    (58)</p>
<p> INCOME BEFORE INCOME TAXES	 156	40     276     101</p>
<p> NET INCOME				97	32     184	78</p>
<p>Noncash credit from</p>
<p>  exchange of preferred stock	10	 -	10	 -</p>
<p> Dividends on preferred stock     (2)     (5)     (8)    (11)</p>
<p>Net income per share</p>
<p>    - Primary			  1.23     .32    2.19     .80</p>
<p>    - Fully diluted		  1.06     .32    2.00     .80</p>
<p>Weighted average shares, in thousands</p>
<p>    - Primary			85,635  83,653  85,322  83,425</p>
<p>    - Fully diluted		93,749  83,653  93,435  84,619</p>
<p>NOTE: Company also reported Q2 &quot;net income adjusted for special items&quot; of $110 million, or $1.26/shr, vs $34 million, or $0.35/shr.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 net includes interest expense, increased income tax estimate with after tax impact of $13 million, or $0.15/shr, and credit on exchange of preferred of $10 million, or $0.12/shr.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
